        TrainingSeed("IBM SkillsBuild", "IBM", "IBM SkillsBuild provides digital learning and career resources for learners and educators.", "Technology, workplace, AI, cybersecurity, data, and other topics in the live catalogue.", "https://skillsbuild.org/", "Course/path specific; check the current catalogue.", "Digital credentials may be available for selected learning; verify course completion requirements."),
